<Base title="About" description="Shem Magnezi is a Senior Staff Software Engineer at Lemonade, previously CTO and co-founder of Wilco (acquired by Lemonade), with senior engineering roles at Meta and WeWork, and first employee at MyRoll (acquired by AVG).">
  <div class="page-head on-night"><div class="wrap"><h1>About</h1></div></div>
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div class="page-copy">
      <p>My name is Shem Magnezi.</p>
      <p>I’m a software engineer with more than 20 years of experience across client and server-side systems, real-time architectures, big data, mobile, and web. I work heavily with AI: I help teams adopt it, accelerate the work of every department, and build tools, products and agents with it. I care a lot about growth mindset and about helping engineering teams work well together.</p>
      <p>I’ve been part of two exits. I was the first employee at MyRoll, which was acquired by AVG, and the CTO and co-founder of <a href="https://trywilco.com">Wilco</a>, a platform that helps developers level up through hands-on practice, which was acquired by Lemonade. I’ve also held senior IC roles at WeWork and Meta. Today I’m a Senior Staff Software Engineer at Lemonade. The details are on <a href="/career/">my career page</a>.</p>
      <p>I also like to <a href="/talks/">speak at conferences</a> and to build <a href="/projects/">side projects</a>.</p>
      <p>You can find me at the beach with a beer in my hand, or at a Maccabi Tel-Aviv football game.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="portrait about-portrait"><img src="/images/shem.jpg" alt="Shem Magnezi on stage with a microphone" width="1283" height="1165" /></div>
  </div>
</Base>
